The glTF and OBJ models (*.gltf, *.obj), their buffer (*.bin), material library (*.mtl) and image (*.png) in this
directory and its subdirectories were made for ModelShot tests from our own geometry and pixel data by generate.mjs,
and are dedicated to the public domain under CC0-1.0.

To the extent possible under law, the ModelShot authors have waived all copyright and related or neighboring rights
to these files. See https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
